#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Valgrind"
msgstr "Instalação do Valgrind"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Valgrind</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale &quot;<application>Valgrind</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:115
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's|/doc/valgrind||' docs/Makefile.in &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr \\\n"
"            --datadir=/usr/share/doc/valgrind-&valgrind-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's|/doc/valgrind||' docs/Makefile.in &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr \\\n"
"           --datadir=/usr/share/doc/valgrind-&valgrind-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make regtest</command>. The tests may "
"hang forever if <xref linkend=\"gdb\"/> is not installed. Some tests are "
"known to hang also, depending on the version of glibc. A few tests can fail "
"in various suites. Problematic tests can be disabled by changing the "
"<userinput>prereq:</userinput> line in the corresponding "
"<filename>.vgtest</filename> file to <userinput>prereq: false</userinput>. "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: &quot;<command>make "
"regtest</command>&quot;. Os testes possivelmente travem para sempre se "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"gdb\"/>&quot; não estiver instalado. Alguns testes "
"também são conhecidos por travarem, dependendo da versão da "
"&quot;glibc&quot;. Alguns testes podem falhar em várias suítes. Testes "
"problemáticos podem ser desabilitados mudando-se a linha "
"&quot;<userinput>prereq:</userinput>&quot; no arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>.vgtest</filename>&quot; correspondente para "
"&quot;<userinput>prereq: false</userinput>&quot;. Por exemplo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:131
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's@prereq:.*@prereq: false@' \\\n"
"    -i {helgrind,drd}/tests/pth_cond_destroy_busy.vgtest</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's@prereq:.*@prereq: false@' \\\n"
"   -i {helgrind,drd}/tests/pth_cond_destroy_busy.vgtest</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>OpenMP</application> tests are skipped if libgomp has been "
"compiled with <option>--enable-linux-futex</option> (the default). If "
"needed, just recompile the libgomp library from the gcc build tree, passing "
"<option>--disable-linux-futex</option> to configure, storing the library to "
"some place and changing the link from "
"<filename>/usr/lib/libgomp.so.1</filename> to point to the new library."
msgstr ""
"Os testes &quot;<application>OpenMP</application>&quot; serão pulados se a "
"&quot;libgomp&quot; tiver sido compilada com &quot;<option>--enable-linux-"
"futex</option>&quot; (o padrão). Se necessário, apenas recompile a "
"biblioteca &quot;libgomp&quot; originária da árvore de construção do "
"&quot;gcc&quot;, passando &quot;<option>--disable-linux-futex</option>&quot;"
" para configurar, armazenando a biblioteca em algum lugar e mudando o link "
"de &quot;<filename>/usr/lib/libgomp.so.1</filename>&quot; para apontar para "
"a nova biblioteca."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:178
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i ... docs/Makefile.in </command>: This sed provides for "
"installing the documentation in a versioned directory."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i ... docs/Makefile.in </command>: Esse &quot;sed&quot; "
"fornece a instalação da documentação em um diretório versionado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/valgrind.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-lto=yes</option>: This option allows building Valgrind with"
" LTO (link time optimization).  This produces a smaller/faster Valgrind (up "
"to 10%), but build time increases to about 5.5 SBU."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-lto=yes</option>: Essa opção permite construir "
"&quot;Valgrind&quot; com &quot;Link Time Optimization&quot; "
"(&quot;LTO&quot;). Isso produz um &quot;Valgrind&quot; menor/mais rápido "
"(até 10%), mas o tempo de construção aumenta para cerca de 5,5 UPC."

